  "title": "(Gluten Free) Magic Cookie Bars",
  "description": "Magic cookie bars can be made gluten-free by making a peanut butter base out of 3 simple ingredients. Layer with chocolate chips, nuts, and coconut for a decadent treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Jewels"
  ],
